- `GET /decks/{id}/cards`: `Pageable` default size 50; projection DTO (không load `generation_prompt`)
- `GET /review/due`: filter `deck_id` trên `user_card_review`, không JOIN `cards`
- FTS: native query `search_vector @@ plainto_tsquery('simple', ?)`
- Leaderboard: Redis `ZADD leaderboard score member`; `ZREVRANGE` top 50
- Streak scheduler: `findByLastStudyDateBeforeAndIsActiveTrue(...)`

