## Async

- Dùng `TaskDispatcher` interface; implement `SpringAsyncDispatcher`
- Job: insert `async_jobs` PENDING → `@Async` → DONE/FAILED + Redis `job:{jobId}`

## Error & security

- `@ControllerAdvice` + exception hierarchy
- JWT filter; `@PreAuthorize` cho ADMIN endpoints
- Validate input (`@Valid`); BCrypt password

## Test

- JUnit 5 + MockMvc; `@SpringBootTest` hoặc slice test cho service
- Test SRS SM-2 edge cases (AGAIN reset, EF floor 1.3)
